+- A store whose `listFor` rejects is answered with an `error` frame carrying `SERVER_ERROR` instead of a `session_list`, and the failure is logged under the `ws` category with the user id and the error ([validated by: answers SERVER_ERROR from the ws log when the store fails to list, and no session_list](../../src/transport/ws/sessionList.test.ts#L55)).
+
+Retention: the rows are metadata — identifiers and counts — and carry no conversation content and no credential material ([validated by: carries only its four fields, so a list can never hand over a conversation or a credential](../../src/infrastructure/stores/sessionStoreListSignature.test.ts#L22)). Answering the frame therefore retains nothing beyond what the session store already holds; how long a store may hold conversation content is the consumer's retention decision under `SessionResumeOptions` (see re-cinq/HALEngine#41).
